        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: The Nativity Story, Alien Invasion Arizona, The Salena Incident\n- People: Catherine Hardwicke, Keisha Castle-Hughes, Oscar Isaac\n- Companies: Temple Hill Entertainment, Lionsgate\n- Events: Academy Awards, Broadcast Film Critics Association Awards\n\nFacts:\n- In 2004, Keisha Castle-Hughes won a Broadcast Film Critics Association Award for Best Young Actor/Actress.\n- Keisha Castle-Hughes was nominated for an Academy Award for Best Actress and was the youngest person nominated in that category at the time.\n- In 2006, The Nativity Story was released as a biblical drama film based on the nativity of Jesus.\n- In 2006, The Nativity Story was directed by Catherine Hardwicke and starred Keisha Castle-Hughes and Oscar Isaac.\n- Temple Hill Entertainment's first film production was The Nativity Story in 2006.\n- Alien Invasion Arizona was also titled The Salena Incident.\n- Alien Invasion Arizona was a straight-to-DVD release produced by Temple Hill Entertainment and distributed by Lionsgate.",
